  "India branded medicines: ~Rs 2.4 lakh crore, growing high single to low double digits; price control is the cap.",
  "US and export generics: large but deflationary; returns need complex products and a clean USFDA record.",
  "Specialty, biosimilars and vaccines: the highest value and the highest risk.",
